WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:12.000
Hey youtubers it’s charlie and now that
we’ve all had a chance to see Sherlock season

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.320
3 it’s time to start talking about season
4 predictions.

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.300
So what I’m going to do in this video is
just list my top 10 with as much evidence

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.680
as possible for each one.

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:22.630
Before we get started I just got some really
good news and since I’m so happy I’m giving

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:27.270
away a sherlock season 3 dvd to 5 random subscribers
in the comments.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:29.000
I’ll announce the winners in my next sherlock
Q&amp;A video.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.190
I will continue to do sherlock videos for
the rest of the year, all of my sherlock,

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:34.370
doctor who, game of thrones and walking dead
videos kind of rotate periodically just to

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:35.970
make it easier to focus on stuff when it’s
most relevant.

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.930
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:40.480
Carefull for spoilers if you haven’t seen
season 3 yet.

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:42.540
We’ll be talking about some very specific
plot points.

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:43.540
Shall we begin.

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:45.350
Top 10 predictions for season 4.

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:47.120
Number 10 - Watson Baby.

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:50.280
Mary Morstan was super pregnant during the
final moments of his last vow.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:53.660
So even if season 4 picks up directly after
that, she’s still going to have the baby

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:55.160
in one of those episodes.

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:58.339
I think we can all imagine that at some point
the life of that baby will be threatened by

00:00:58.339 --> 00:01:01.820
the villain and sherlock’s last vow will
continue to be a big theme.

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:05.010
Raise your hand if you think that Sherlock
really could be a girl’s name.

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:07.850
Or suggest your favorite watson baby girl
names in the comments.

00:01:07.850 --> 00:01:12.730
Number 9 - Sherlock running around with the
watson baby will break the internet.

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:13.979
Tumblr specifically.

00:01:13.979 --> 00:01:17.229
Benedict Cumberbatch was the most reblogged
person on tumblr last year.

00:01:17.229 --> 00:01:20.570
So imagine what will happen when he starts
clueing for looks with a baby.

00:01:20.570 --> 00:01:23.549
Using baby’s in scenes is really hard from
a production stand point.

00:01:23.549 --> 00:01:28.030
So don’t expect there to be an actual baby
on screen for a lot of the more intense action

00:01:28.030 --> 00:01:29.030
scenes.

00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:31.140
But baker street babies is totally going to
be a thing.

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:34.290
I guess you could also consider this a shoutout
to the baker street babes.

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:36.799
They have an awesome sherlock podcast.

00:01:36.799 --> 00:01:39.440
Number 8 - Billy Wiggins will be back.

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:41.670
He even called himself Sherlock’s protege.

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:45.409
When he started making deductions in molly’s
lab I actually wondered if there was a connection

00:01:45.409 --> 00:01:47.470
between drug addiction and savants.

00:01:47.470 --> 00:01:49.700
Or if he was just naturally gifted.

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:53.850
Either way in the canon the Billy and the
Wiggins characters are both really important,

00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:56.820
so regardless of which stories they adapt
for each new episode he’ll be there.

00:01:56.820 --> 00:02:00.990
In his last vow he kind of took on the collective
role of the homeless network or baker street

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:04.729
irregulars depending on how you view them,
so I’m also wondering if he’s going to

00:02:04.729 --> 00:02:07.090
to start running sherlock’s homeless network
too.

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:09.220
Number 7 - Even more mycroft.

00:02:09.220 --> 00:02:13.090
This season dealt a lot with Sherlock’s
family, but I don’t expect benedict cumberbatch’s

00:02:13.090 --> 00:02:14.430
parents to return.

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:18.820
And if they do have cameos, they will be more
like empty hearse than his last vow.

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:22.190
The Sherlock Mycroft scenes are so popular
in the fandom though and the mycroft character

00:02:22.190 --> 00:02:26.160
is so well developed that I think he’ll
continue to be heavily featured.

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:30.360
A big part of their relationship that was
new in season 3 was their childhood.

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:33.570
Learning about redbeard as well as actually
seeing young sherlock.

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:35.550
Played by steven moffat’s real life son.

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:39.800
The next logical step would be to feature
flashbacks to teenage sherlock and mycroft.

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:44.620
In the canon mycroft is about 7 years older
so it would be like teenage sherlock and mycroft

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:45.620
at university.

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:46.620
Quick side note.

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:50.050
If you haven’t seen it yet, Young Sherlock
holmes was an 80s movie that depicted sherlock

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:51.770
during his university years.

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:55.290
The actor that played him Nicholas Rowe is
on Davincis demons now.

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:58.660
Number 6 - Mary will be a much bigger part
of the action.

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:02.450
In his last vow we found out she was an elite
assassin and a deadshot.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:06.320
So there’s no way season 4 isn’t going
to invoke those skills.

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:07.900
Especially since she’s a mother now.

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:10.870
At this point she’s kind of like Uma Thurman
in Kill Bill.

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:15.260
Someone will probably try to steal baby watson
and sherlock and john will have to stop her

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:17.320
from killing everyone responsible.

00:03:17.320 --> 00:03:20.820
I can’t wait to see ninja mary fight scenes.

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:24.010
Someone actually asked me if we’d ever get
to see a sherlock fight scene but we kind

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:25.650
of already did during scandal.

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:28.210
The next logical step would be a mary fight
scene.

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:31.190
We’ve really only seen her sharpshooter
skills.

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:34.290
Number 5 - Sherlock will still be a murderer.

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:37.200
I don’t think that the series will backtrack
on sherlock killing magnussen.

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:41.280
It was a big part of his last vow and taking
that away from him would kind of undo the

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.810
sincerity of that promise.

00:03:42.810 --> 00:03:46.610
Mycroft’s comment about learning your lesson
is a tip off that there won’t be any major

00:03:46.610 --> 00:03:49.270
consequences to sherlock than we’ve already
seen.

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:53.181
I think the government was satisfied with
mycroft’s solution and the season 4 villain

00:03:53.181 --> 00:03:56.360
will negate any further concerns.

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:58.140
Number 4 - The stories.

00:03:58.140 --> 00:04:01.420
This is a bit of a problem, because they’ve
already done most of Conan Doyle’s best

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:02.590
known stories.

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:04.740
Each season has featured on of his four novels.

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:09.140
And they’ve already done a study in scarlet,
hound of baskerville and sign of four.

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:11.950
So the next logical step is to do Valley of
Fear.

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:14.660
It actually features the first chronological
appearance of moriarty.

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:15.660
It also features sussex villiage.

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:16.660
Remember that place Janine bought the cottage.

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:19.579
In the canon it takes place before rickenback
fall, but if moriarty is back.

00:04:19.579 --> 00:04:21.400
This story would make the most sense.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:26.789
Other stories they could do are Lady Frances
Carfax, Dying Detective and Red Headed League.

00:04:26.789 --> 00:04:29.729
Number 3 - A return to proper form.

00:04:29.729 --> 00:04:34.050
Steven Moffat said that as sherlock gets more
emotional he becomes less brilliant.

00:04:34.050 --> 00:04:37.699
The final moments of his last vow imply that
he’s returning to form.

00:04:37.699 --> 00:04:43.069
even if the high functioning sociopath line
is unreliable narration.

00:04:43.069 --> 00:04:47.180
In my mind palace the best sherlock holmes
stories are always like chess games.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:49.360
Very calculated and precise.

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:52.639
So I don’t think we’ll see another episode
like sign of three with sherlock dancing his

00:04:52.639 --> 00:04:54.110
way to clues stoned and drunk.

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:55.360
Which kind of implies that the major arc will
have to be something that requires him to

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:56.360
be in proper form.

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:57.360
2 - The final solution.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:01.110
What better to snap sherlock back into form
than a doomsday scenario set in motion by

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:02.919
the one true moriarty.

00:05:02.919 --> 00:05:05.710
Notice I said one true moriarty.

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:08.360
In canon moriarty is every bit as clever as
sherlock.

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:12.300
And if sherlock and mycroft were one step
ahead of moriarty during rikenback fall.

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:17.930
Then wouldn’t it stand to reason that moriarty
would have had his own 13 different solutions.

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:21.160
Regardless of who the villain is, I think
that post credit scene is the signal that

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:23.780
a doomsday scenario has been set in motion.

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:25.229
Like a last will and testament.

00:05:25.229 --> 00:05:30.659
and my number 1 prediction - moriarty really
is dead and that clip we saw was being used

00:05:30.659 --> 00:05:32.090
by another villain.

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:34.750
Rule number 1 the doctor always lies.

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:38.800
In the world of sherlock different characters
take on the role.

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:42.960
and in this case the mad man in the box is
moriarty inside your television.

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:46.370
With so many other villains to explore it
doesn’t make a lot of sense for Moffat and

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:51.389
Gatiss to retread old territory.Just to be
clear, I definitely think Andrew Scott will

00:05:51.389 --> 00:05:53.000
be a part of season 4.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.280
Just not in the way you hope.

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:58.590
I really think it’s just another villain
just enacting Moriarty’s doomsday scenario.

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:01.219
Or enacting their own scenario using him as
a front.

00:06:01.219 --> 00:06:06.100
A couple of people it could be including Moriarty’s
brother who’s also named james.

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:11.939
the real colonel moran, henry peter from the
lady carfax story, Rene Heron, Fantomas and

00:06:11.939 --> 00:06:13.850
Von Bork.

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:18.190
If it is in fact moriarty, here’s one possible
reason why he’s still alive.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:22.789
In the story of the final solution we find
out that moriarty’s brother is called james

00:06:22.789 --> 00:06:26.560
and the one true moriarty is called professor
moriarty.

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:29.969
That would mean that it was the brother that
killed himself on the rooftop and played the

00:06:29.969 --> 00:06:31.150
richard brooke role.

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:34.289
In canon professor moriarty is always someone
who only acts through agents.

00:06:34.289 --> 00:06:38.849
It’s a major character trait that he never
directly acts against people, especially sherlock.

00:06:38.849 --> 00:06:43.530
And in rikenback and great game he is very
much up in sherlock’s face.

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:50.150
Take that evidence as you will, but let me
know what your biggest prediction is for season

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:51.150
4.

00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:52.601
A lot of people have been asking me about
when it’s going to air and unless there

00:06:52.601 --> 00:06:57.240
is a major delay in filming, it will be the
same time next year.

00:06:57.240 --> 00:07:00.949
They already have the story, the just need
to schedule the actors.

00:07:00.949 --> 00:07:03.219
A lot of you guys have requested a moriarty
vid specifically.

00:07:03.219 --> 00:07:06.229
So I might do one next week if you guys really
want it.

00:07:06.229 --> 00:07:10.330
I’ll probably post my season 4 q&amp;a video
wednesday or thursday.

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:14.610
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:17.809
I’ll also be doing a new Doctor Who Series
8 Q&amp;A this week.

00:07:17.809 --> 00:07:21.650
And details on the weekly walking dead giveaway
I’ll be doing when it comes back.

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:25.749
Right now click here for my breakdown of his
last vow and click here for the q&amp;a.

00:07:25.749 --> 00:07:27.759
Thanks so much for watching, see you guys
tonight.

00:07:27.759 --> 00:07:28.259
high fives!

